---

# 1. Purpose

This document defines the technical implementation requirements for the Quantum Care platform.

The current implementation consists of:

```text
Quantum Care
│
├── Patient Website
└── Hospital Kiosk Interface
```

The kiosk is **not a separate frontend project**.

The same React application will contain:

```text
PATIENT MODE
+
KIOSK MODE
```

The backend remains common to both.

The system must be designed so that future features such as doctor dashboards, payment gateways, cloud storage, ABDM integration, and physical kiosk hardware can be added without changing the core architecture.

