The current Quantum Care prototype is complete when:

### Patient

* Can register using Aadhaar number.
* Can receive and verify OTP in prototype mode.
* Can create a password/PIN.
* Can log in using Aadhaar + password/PIN.
* Can complete personal profile.
* Can enter medical information.
* Can describe current symptoms.
* Can use voice.
* Can use touch/select inputs.
