* Can receive a digital clinical report.
* Can upload medical documents.
* Can view OCR/extracted information.
* Can see a medical timeline.
* Can book an appointment without payment.
* Can generate an appointment QR.

### Kiosk

* Uses the same React application.
* Has a dedicated kiosk layout.
* Allows authorized hospital kiosk user login.
* Can identify existing patients.
* Can register new patients.
* Can retrieve patient information.
* Can create appointments.
* Can initiate clinical intake.
* Can update patient information.
* Can process documents.
* Can complete the patient session.
* Clears the session afterward.

### System

* Uses MongoDB locally.
* Uses local document storage.
* Uses external AI APIs.
* Uses OTP abstraction.
* Uses Aadhaar-provider abstraction.
* Does not require payment.
* Does not require cloud storage.
* Does not require a separate kiosk frontend.
* Has role-based access.
* Has validation.
* Has audit logging.
* Has automated tests.
* Can run locally.

