# 97. Final Architecture Principle

The most important decision in this revision is:

```text
                  QUANTUM CARE
                       |
           +-----------+-----------+
           |                       |
           v                       v
      PATIENT WEB             KIOSK MODE
           |                       |
           +-----------+-----------+
                       |
                       v
                  SAME REACT APP
                       |
                       v
                 SAME REST API
                       |
                       v
                 SAME SERVICES
                       |
                       v
                    MongoDB
```

There is **one application, one backend, one database, and one clinical data model**.

The website and kiosk are simply different experiences over the same system.

That keeps the current prototype manageable while leaving a clean path toward the larger MediKiosk concept in the original problem statement, which ultimately envisions patient identification, structured history capture, document digitization, clinical summarization, consent, and integration with hospital systems/ABDM.
